###Simple upload
POST {{host}}/v1/auth/upload
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=boundary

--boundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="name"

hello-buyfrom-2-time-price
--boundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="description"

Description

--boundary--

###Test upload without file
POST {{host}}/v1/auth/upload
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=boundary

--boundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="name"

hello-buyfrom-2-time-price
--boundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="description"

Description
--boundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="buyFrom"

This is purchase from
--boundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="buyPrice"

22.89
--boundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="buyAt"

07/01/2026
--boundary--

###Test upload with items
POST {{host}}/v1/auth/upload
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=boundary

--boundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="name"

Invoice with items
--boundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="buyFrom"

Supplier Co.
--boundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="buyAt"

07/01/2026
--boundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="buyPrice"

99.99
--boundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="items"

[{"itemName":"Widget A","itemQty":"2","unitPrice":"25.00","subTotal":"50.00"},{"itemName":"Widget B","itemQty":"1","unitPrice":"49.99","subTotal":"49.99"}]
--boundary--

### OCR - extract invoice (image)
POST {{host}}/v1/auth/ocr
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=boundary

--boundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="invoice.png"
Content-Type: image/png

< ./input/PNG-image.png
--boundary--

### OCR - extract invoice (PDF)
POST {{host}}/v1/auth/ocr
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=boundary

--boundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="invoice.pdf"
Content-Type: application/pdf

< ./input/Ipafpro-invoice-2024.pdf
--boundary--